msgctxt "64"
msgid "(Those two again...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "That was delicious, wasn't it, Mizuki-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Yeah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "...I feel bad for making you pay for all this food, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Come on, it's no problem at all! After all, being here with you is "
"priceless to me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Aww! Thanks, Akimoto-kun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "So, where to next?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Well, I was thinking of getting some souvenirs for my friends back home... "
"Where do you think we can get some?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Hm... I think there's a place called <Color:7>Stone Market<Color:Default>  "
"out on the main street. Maybe they'll have something there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Okay, let's give it a shot!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Anything you say, my dear Mizuki-chan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"I have to say though, Akimoto-kun... I had no idea you knew so much about "
"Okinawa!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Hahaha! I spent many sleepless nights researching the islands just for this "
"occasion!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "That's amazing, Akimoto-kun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "(Looks like they're heading to Stone Market for souvenirs...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"(This vacation seems... surprisingly normal. Maybe I should check in on "
"them over there, just in case.)"
msgstr ""

